{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game name &quot;Strange Dreams&quot;, game reminder/communication group 1032181602</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shareholders and audience grandfathers! The game is expected to be released on September 19th, and there will be some activities to send free activation codes before the release!! The more wish lists you send, the more you send!! Please join the group and pay attention to the notification~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any ideas or creativity, be sure to throw them into the comment section or join the group (1032181602) for discussion! Your suggestions are the core driving force for making the game better! Don't forget to pay attention to the development progress, and the three consecutive hints [doge] are the greatest spiritual support for the development team! The Strange Dream cannot be separated from the strong help of all the grandfathers! See you in our group, let's polish this nuclear dream together!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main style:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Dream Core, Children's Core, Old Core, Concrete Core, Toilet Core, Threshold Space, etc., focusing on nostalgic tearful eyes+Chinese core art+a small amount of melancholy/micro horror elements (not intended to be terrifying, but hoping to make it a nostalgic tearful eye that everyone likes)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >plot:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had a dream, but you found that you couldn't wake up, and the contents of the dream were very strange. You could only explore step by step and finally return to that restless city Do you really want to go back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >playing method</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Dreams &quot;will enhance gameplay by setting up various fun mini game levels, not limited to finding different or walking simulators. Stay tuned!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808860?t=1754638896"