 team! The Strange Dream cannot be separated from the strong help of all the grandfathers! See you in our group, let's polish this nuclear dream together!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main style:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Dream Core, Children's Core, Old Core, Concrete Core, Toilet Core, Threshold Space, etc., focusing on nostalgic tearful eyes+Chinese core art+a small amount of melancholy/micro horror elements (not intended to be terrifying, but hoping to make it a nostalgic tearful eye that everyone likes)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >plot:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had a dream, but you found that you couldn't wake up, and the contents of the dream were very strange. You could only explore step by step and finally return to that restless city Do you really want to go back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >playing method</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Dreams &quot;will enhance gameplay by setting up various fun mini game levels, not limited to finding different or walking simulators. Stay tuned!!</p>","developers":["\u8349\u5730w"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808860/070455dfd1214a0625a2daa138d8da422dc75146/header.jpg?t=1754638896","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 1. Age classification and content disclosure </h2>","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156707,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156707/movie480.mp4?t=1753940977","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store